2026-11-09T20:29:54+09:00 main headroom[1756]:   - Auto-detects provider from request (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, etc.)
2026-11-09T20:29:54+09:00 main headroom[1756]:   - Anthropic: Uses native memory tool (memory_20250818) - subscription safe
2026-11-09T20:29:54+09:00 main headroom[1756]:   - OpenAI/Gemini/Others: Uses function calling format
