2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]: Routing:
2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]:   /v1/messages                    → https://api.anthropic.com
2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]:   /v1/chat/completions            → https://api.openai.com
